{"Ißt":[{"id":765113,"text":"Ißt du oft auswärts?","tr":{"en":"Do you eat out often?","ru":"Вы часто питаетесь вне дома?","uk":"Ти часто їш не вдома?"}},{"id":12912636,"text":"Ißt du Äpfel?","tr":{"en":"Do you eat apples?","ru":"Ты ешь яблоки?"}},{"id":12641268,"text":"Ißt du immer so?","tr":{"en":"Do you always eat like this?","ru":"Ты всегда так ешь?"}},{"id":13250956,"text":"Ißt du in der Schule zu Mittag?","tr":{"en":"Do you eat lunch at school?","ru":"Ты обедаешь в школе?"}},{"id":12721279,"text":"Ißt du wirklich gar kein Fleisch mehr?","tr":{"en":"Do you really never eat meat anymore?","ru":"Ты правда совсем перестал есть мясо?"}}],"Iß":[{"id":13231698,"text":"Iß schnell auf!","tr":{"en":"Hurry up and finish eating.","ru":"Доедай быстрее!"}},{"id":12906789,"text":"Iß mit mir morgen zu Abend!","tr":{"en":"Have dinner with me tomorrow.","ru":"Поужинай завтра со мной."}},{"id":12407263,"text":"Iß deine Suppe, solange sie warm ist!","tr":{"en":"Eat your soup while it's warm.","ru":"Ешь суп, пока он тёплый."}},{"id":12635440,"text":"Iß doch etwas!","tr":{"en":"Why don't you eat something?"}},{"id":13425258,"text":"Iß nicht zu schnell!","tr":{"en":"Don't eat too quickly."}}],"ißt":[{"id":13701186,"text":"Wer ißt den Rest?","tr":{"en":"Who'll eat the rest?","ru":"Кто съест остальное?"}},{"id":12816688,"text":"Niemand ißt etwas.","tr":{"en":"No one is eating.","ru":"Никто не ест."}},{"id":13636844,"text":"Tom ißt gerne Nudeln.","tr":{"en":"Tom likes pasta.","ru":"Том любит макароны."}},{"id":12544788,"text":"Wie oft ißt du Schwein?","tr":{"en":"How often do you eat pork?","ru":"Как часто ты ешь свинину?"}},{"id":13555166,"text":"Tom ißt keine Schokolade.","tr":{"en":"Tom doesn't eat chocolate.","ru":"Том не ест шоколад."}}],"iß":[{"id":13305377,"text":"Sei still und iß!","tr":{"en":"Be quiet and eat."}}]}